          "entradaId": "freeman-513",
          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "Roads of some kind must, have existed in former times in Palestine, though nothing worthy of the name is to be found there today. The use of chariots, and the opening and preservation of the way to the Cities of Refuge, and such expressions as are found in this text, seem to impl…"
      }
